cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RISK, please cite the Bioinformatics paper and the software archive."
title: "RISK: Regional Inference of Significant Kinships"
abstract: "RISK is a Python package for scalable network annotation and visualization. It integrates community detection, overrepresentation analysis with user-provided annotation sets, and publication-ready contour-overlay visualizations for biological and interdisciplinary networks."
